    },
    {
      "text": "Mix chicken stock, soy sauce, cornstarch, and garlic in a bowl; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ikdd4fYNKqHy9uouhMpbIDPVL3I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231681-shrimp-stir-fry-VAT-step-02-7fdf587bacaa48f2a23bde225563723a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231681/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat sesame oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat until oil shimmers; cook and stir vegetables in hot oil until softened, about 4 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9thfcd6bJKnFwDTDoelN9RjEQpg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231681-shrimp-stir-fry-VAT-step-03-50d7c7a359eb496581245dc3ab251782.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/231681/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add shrimp; cook and stir until shrimp begin to turn pink, about 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m7-yqu3170ABQEWLIaWMDqpr-YE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-231681-shrimp-stir-fry-VAT-step-04-4270ee92058a4e71b8c9a66b64b7e546.jpg"
